WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
In the final years of the Ming dynasty, droughts came year after year, the fields cracked dry, and the people's lives were extremely hard.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The crops in the fields had withered yellow, and the villagers looked at the sky, hoping for rain.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Heavy taxes and labor duties pressed down on the farmers, and large-scale uprisings broke out in place after place.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Officials pressed them to hand over their taxes, and the villagers lowered their heads, unable to say a single word.

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Li Zicheng stepped forward and led the suffering farmers, forming a brave force.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.000
Standing on high ground, Li Zicheng called out loudly that he would lead everyone to a better life.

7
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.500
They raised high the banner of the Dashing King, and the people following them grew more numerous day by day.

8
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.500
The peasant army passed through mountains and villages, marching all the way toward Beijing.

9
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:49.000
They passed village after village, and their column stretched like a long dragon with no end in sight.

10
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.500
This force deeply shook the Ming dynasty, and the situation across the land began to change from then on.

11
00:00:54.500 --> 00:01:00.500
In the distance, Beijing appeared faintly in the evening glow, and the atmosphere grew more and more tense.
